<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.05.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.05.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 1,372,500 shares in Polish food producer Sokolow SA at 3.05 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Sokolow traded at 3.8 zlotys in a volume of 666,154 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
